<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who says--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他说——

00:58:38.600 --> 00:58:42.050
<v Rennie Sparks>You either step up, or you get stepped over. It's that simple.
<v Rennie Sparks>你要么站出来，要么被踩在脚下。就这么简单。

00:58:42.050 --> 00:58:47.050
